<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 2.7pt; text-align: center">(To be Executed by the Registered Holder
in order to Convert the Note)</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0in; text-align: justify">The undersigned hereby irrevocably elects
to convert *$<U>___________</U>of the above Note into  ___________Shares of Common Stock of NEWGENIVF GROUP LIMITED (&ldquo;Shares&rdquo;) according
to the conditions set forth in such Note, as of the date written below.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0in; text-indent: 1in">If Shares are to be issued in the name
of a person other than the undersigned, the undersigned will pay all transfer and other taxes and charges payable with respect thereto.</P>

